# Operation Failed$
# /etc/systemd/system/ssh.socket.d/listen.conf (hardn v0.3.x)$
# sets ssh.socket to port 2230, but it never took effect:$
# ssh.socket is configured for [0.0.0.0:22 [::]:22] (no$
# daemon-reload since it was written, D9). Migrating it now$
# could not be rolled back (SSH_LISTEN_CONF_NOT_IN_EFFECT)$
$
  To go on: first make sure the firewall lets port 2230 through,$
  then run `systemctl daemon-reload` and$
  `systemctl restart ssh.socket`, check that a new SSH$
  connection to port 2230 works, and run hardn again.$
$

